      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 2.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.81,
      "end_seconds": 8.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.95,
      "end_seconds": 18.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "I, I wanted to to get a purple rash that does not fade looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.66,
      "end_seconds": 22.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.12,
      "end_seconds": 28.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "It's, It's been one week, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.93,
      "end_seconds": 33.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.42,
      "end_seconds": 37.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.01,
      "end_seconds": 41.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "any diarrhoea, cough or stiff neck at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.86,
      "end_seconds": 46.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Hmm, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.58,
      "end_seconds": 52.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.99,
      "end_seconds": 57.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.01,
      "end_seconds": 78.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.42,
      "end_seconds": 82.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.8,
      "end_seconds": 89.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.3,
      "end_seconds": 107.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.02,
      "end_seconds": 112.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.52,
      "end_seconds": 117.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.42,
      "end_seconds": 127.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.04,
      "end_seconds": 131.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.41,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.97,
      "end_seconds": 141.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.95,
      "end_seconds": 146.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.41,
      "end_seconds": 151.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.12,
      "end_seconds": 158.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.51,
      "end_seconds": 177.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.8,
      "end_seconds": 182.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.86,
      "end_seconds": 185.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 192.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "I, I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.08,
      "end_seconds": 196.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.18,
      "end_seconds": 207.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.55,
      "end_seconds": 232.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 107 over 67, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, temperature 38.0, pulse is 105 beats a minute, weight 88 kilos, height 163 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.59,
      "end_seconds": 235.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.98,
      "end_seconds": 240.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.6,
      "end_seconds": 248.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.37,
      "end_seconds": 252.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.34,
      "end_seconds": 274.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "the purple spots do not fade when I press a glass on them, and he is floppy and drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.23,
      "end_seconds": 289.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.86,
      "end_seconds": 304.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Putting it all together, I don't have a clear answer today: possible meningococcal sepsis is possible, and so is a viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.73,
      "end_seconds": 307.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.65,
      "end_seconds": 336.8,
      "duration_seconds": 28.15,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like possible meningococcal sepsis, but I'd like to confirm i think urgent blood tests makes sense here, for possible sepsis i'm going to put you on benzylpenicillin, 600 milligrams, once now, single dose that's for possible meningococcal sepsis i am giving an antibiotic injection now and calling an ambulance i'm going to send a referral to the emergency team"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.17,
      "end_seconds": 348.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "keep an eye out, and and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.72,
      "end_seconds": 352.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I know what to watch for"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.57,
      "end_seconds": 359.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I'd like you back straight away. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.77,
      "end_seconds": 363.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
